The objective function is to minimize the MG model's ATC, which includes the capital investment cost (CI),operation and maintenance cost (OM), and replacement cost (RC) of the system's parts (PV, WT, BT, FC, EL, HT),but excluding EV and HV purchasing costs, as illustrated in Eq. (36).36\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
