                                                  \begin{document}$$ ATC = C_{CI, OM}^{PV} + C_{CI, OM}^{WT} + C_{CI, OM,RC}^{BT} + C_{CI, OM,RC}^{FC} + C_{CI, OM,RC}^{EL} + C_{CI, OM}^{HT} $$\end{document}

The project lifespan (N) and the interest rate (\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
